{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cfpgpz76nLKimUVZEMctf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Credit-limit increase decision: CR-9204, Acme Manufacturing\n\n## Decision: REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\n\n**The requested credit limit of $1,300,000 exceeds the policy maximum. The customer is ineligible.**\n\n---\n\n### Analysis\n\n**1. The request**\n- Request ID: CR-9204\n- Customer: Acme Mfg. Holdings (ERP C-1001), doing business as Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\n- Current limit: $250,000\n- Requested limit: $1,300,000\n- Request date: 2026-09-23\n- Requestor: Sarah Chen, Enterprise Account Executive\n- Basis: Parent guarantee (Acme Group Holdings)\n\n**2. The customer**\n- ERP: Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)\n- CRM: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\n- DUNS: 04-812-7730 (consistent across records)\n- Account tier: Strategic\n- Matched ✓\n\n**3. Policy in effect**\nNorthstar Credit Policy 2026 (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31) applies to the 2026-09-23 request date.\n\n**4. Payment history**\nPolicy 2026 requires: no invoice due in the 12 months before the request may be paid more than 30 days late or remain unpaid more than 30 days after due date.\n\nInvoices for C-1001 in the 12 months before 2026-09-23 (from 2025-09-23):\n- INV-60412 (2025-10-14, due 2025-11-28): paid 2025-11-24 → 4 days early ✓\n- INV-62011 (2026-06-10, due 2026-07-25): paid 2026-07-22 → 3 days early ✓\n- INV-62305 (2026-08-18, due 2026-10-02): not yet due as of request date ✓\n\n**Payment history: ELIGIBLE**\n\n**5. Maximum credit limit**\n- Policy base maximum for Strategic accounts: **$750,000**\n- Parent guarantee in force:\n  - Document: GRT-ACME-2026\n  - Guarantor: Acme Group Holdings, Inc.\n  - Covers: Acme Mfg. Holdings (this customer)\n  - Guarantee amount: **$400,000**\n  - Effective: 2026-01-01 to 2027-12-31 (request date 2026-09-23 is within term ✓)\n  \n- **Maximum limit under policy 2026: $750,000 + $400,000 = $1,150,000**\n- **Requested limit: $1,300,000**\n- **Requested limit exceeds maximum by $150,000**\n\n**Eligibility: EXCEEDED**\n\n**6–8. Authority and decision**\nEven though the required approvers are the Director of Finance (Elena Novak) and the VP Sales (Michael Torres) for concurrence under policy 2026, neither can approve a limit above the policy maximum. The policy maximum is not subject to override by approval authority.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9204\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001), doing business as Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"current_limit\": 250000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 1300000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example, Enterprise Account Executive)\",\n    \"basis\": \"guarantee\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"exceeded\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 1150000,\n    \"basis\": \"Strategic account tier base maximum $750,000; parent guarantee (Acme Group Holdings Inc., GRT-ACME-2026, effective 2026-01-01 to 2027-12-31) adds $400,000\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Credit Policy 2026 (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31)\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Director of Finance with VP Sales concurrence\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Elena Novak\",\n        \"role\": \"Director of Finance\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Michael Torres\",\n        \"role\": \"VP Sales\",\n        \"kind\": \"concurrence\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Parent Company Guarantee GRT-ACME-2026: Acme Group Holdings guarantees Acme Mfg. Holdings, limited to $400,000, effective 2026-01-01 to 2027-12-31\",\n    \"CRM account CRM-2048 tier: Strategic\",\n    \"Credit Policy 2026 Section 5: maximum for Strategic accounts is $750,000; parent guarantee raises maximum by guaranteed amount\",\n    \"Payment history: INV-60412 paid on time (2025-11-24, due 2025-11-28); INV-62011 paid on time (2026-07-22, due 2026-07-25); INV-62305 not yet due (due 2026-10-02, as of request date 2026-09-23). No invoices late or unpaid beyond 30 days.\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25175,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25175},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e687a6cc-cc40-4b57-bfc9-0b3c982f7906","uuid":"b28f05c3-4e60-4c1a-8453-dcd376245daf","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:26:43.306Z","request_id":"req_011Cfpgpyfot88H1DpaoXxBD"}
